-- 9. 赋权给 hiops 运行账号
GRANT ALL PRIVILEGES ON ALL TABLES IN SCHEMA public TO hiops;
GRANT ALL PRIVILEGES ON ALL SEQUENCES IN SCHEMA public TO hiops;
